---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Mental Performance App for Athletes';
const description = 'Mental performance training for athletes and everyday movers, including body awareness, breathing, reflection and mindset skills.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<section class="page-hero purple-bg"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow purple-text">Mental Performance</div><h1>Mindset tools for athletes at every level.</h1><p class="lead">The Mindset pillar supports mental performance with simple practices like body scans, diaphragmatic breathing, reflection and awareness.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="container"><article><h2>What this section should cover</h2><p>Mental performance content can help the brand reach people searching for focus, motivation, behavior change, sport psychology, stress management, confidence and consistency. The app can be positioned as a practical bridge between physical training and mental skills.</p><div class="callout purple-border">Content angle: mental performance is trainable, just like movement.</div><h2>Recommended content under this pillar</h2><ul><li><a href="/mental-performance/mental-performance-training-for-athletes/">Mental performance training for athletes</a></li><li><a href="/fitness-apps/all-in-one-physical-mental-health-app/">All-in-one physical and mental health app</a></li><li><a href="/corporate-wellness/">Corporate wellness programs</a></li></ul></article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
